                                            "type": "basic",
                                            "name": "Select",
                                            "actions": [
                                                {
                                                    "comment": "추가옵션을 비우면 그 그룹의 선택과 직접입력 글자를 함께 지운다 — 선택을 지웠는데 딸린\n                     문구만 남아 주문에 실려 가는 것을 막는다",
                                                    "type": "change",
                                                    "handler": "setState",
                                                    "params": {
                                                        "target": "$parent._local",
                                                        "additionalSelections": "{{$event.target.value === '' ? Object.fromEntries(Object.entries($parent._local.additionalSelections ?? {}).filter(([k]) => Number(k) !== Number(addGroup.id))) : Object.assign({}, $parent._local.additionalSelections ?? {}, { [addGroup.id]: Number($event.target.value) })}}",
                                                        "additionalCustomTexts": "{{Object.fromEntries(Object.entries($parent._local.additionalCustomTexts ?? {}).filter(([k]) => Number(k) !== Number(addGroup.id)))}}"
                                                    }
                                                }
                                            ],
                                            "props": {
                                                "data-testid": "modal-add-option-{{addGroup.id}}",
                                                "className": "w-full",
                                                "value": "{{$parent._local.additionalSelections?.[addGroup.id] ?? ''}}",
                                                "placeholder": "$t:shop.additional_option_placeholder",
                                                "options": "{{[{ value: '', label: $t('shop.additional_option_placeholder') }, ...(addGroup.values ?? []).map(v => ({ value: v.id, label: v.price_adjustment > 0 ? v.name + ' (' + (v.multi_currency_price_adjustment?.[_global.preferredCurrency ?? _global.defaultCurrency]?.formatted ?? v.price_adjustment_formatted ?? ('+' + v.price_adjustment.toLocaleString())) + ')' : v.name }))]}}"
                                            }
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "comment": "직접입력 칸 — 선택된 선택지가 allow_custom_text 일 때만 노출. 입력란임이 명확하도록 라벨 + 테두리/배경 스타일 적용",
                                            "type": "basic",
                                            "name": "Div",
                                            "if": "{{(addGroup.values ?? []).find(v => v.id === Number($parent._local.additionalSelections?.[addGroup.id]))?.allow_custom_text === true}}",
                                            "props": {
                                                "className": "mt-2"
                                            },
                                            "children": [
                                                {
                                                    "type": "basic",
                                                    "name": "Label",
                                                    "props": {
                                                        "className": "block text-xs text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 mb-1"
                                                    },
                                                    "text": "$t:shop.additional_option_custom_text_label"
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "type": "basic",
                                                    "name": "Input",
                                                    "actions": [
                                                        {
                                                            "comment": "공백만 남으면 키 자체를 지운다 — 빈 문자열을 «입력했다» 로 저장하지 않기 위해서다",
                                                            "type": "input",
                                                            "handler": "setState",
                                                            "params": {
                                                                "target": "$parent._local",
                                                                "additionalCustomTexts": "{{$event.target.value.trim() === '' ? Object.fromEntries(Object.entries($parent._local.additionalCustomTexts ?? {}).filter(([k]) => Number(k) !== Number(addGroup.id))) : Object.assign({}, $parent._local.additionalCustomTexts ?? {}, { [addGroup.id]: $event.target.value })}}"
                                                            }
